\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"40.6 58.6 93.7 100.6 107.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Onlardan çekil, yanlarından oturma<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"128\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 128.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 33.0 33.0 39.7 46.6 48.7 60.7 60.7 67.6 67.6 83.3 90.0 90.0 96.7 96.7 103.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 33.0 39.7 48.7 90.0 103.6 111.7\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> -İbni âmir kıraetinde tef'ilden «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"62\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 61.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 19.4 19.4 26.3 33.0 33.0 45.0 51.7 51.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 19.4 26.3 33.0 45.0\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> »<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"96\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 95.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 33.8 44.3 44.3 51.0 53.3 53.3 65.3 72.8\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.8 53.3 79.6\" y=\"26.3 21.0 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> şayed Şeytan sana unutturursa- seni işgal eder, bu nehyi unutmânâ sebeb olursa -ki bu ihtimal, hıtabın her mü'mine amm olması haysiyyetiyledir. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"330\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 329.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 33.7 33.7 42.7 42.7 50.3 57.0 57.0 67.6 75.0 90.7 90.7 97.6 97.6 105.7 112.6 112.6 120.0 135.7 144.7 160.6 174.0 174.0 181.6 181.6 192.7 192.7 192.7 201.7 209.3 225.0 234.0 234.0 240.7 256.6 256.6 265.6 265.6 272.3 272.3 279.0 294.7 306.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25